	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0101_cleaningm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はやく　そうじを　おわらさねば！
それまで　まってくださいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T11:45:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:49:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はやく　掃除を　終わらさねば！
それまで　待ってくださいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T11:45:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:51:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ストッパー解除前
・GRIDX＝16、GRIDZ＝7～9
　を倍速で往復
・posを踏むと主人公に隣接して
　メッセージ表示、その後、主人公一歩下がる
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T09:30:29" />
		</CommentCell>
